{"verse_key": "13:43", "surah": 13, "verse": 43, "text_uthmani": "وَيَقُولُ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ لَسْتَ مُرْسَلًا ۚ قُلْ كَفَىٰ بِٱللَّهِ شَهِيدًۢا بَيْنِى وَبَيْنَكُمْ وَمَنْ عِندَهُۥ عِلْمُ ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ", "translation": "And those who have disbelieved say, \"You are not a messenger.\" Say, [O Muḥammad], \"Sufficient is Allāh as Witness between me and you, and [the witness of] whoever has knowledge of the Scripture.\"<sup foot_note=196563>1</sup>", "verse_from_ms": 1050990, "verse_to_ms": 1068360, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/13.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "وَيَقُولُ", "start_ms": 1050990, "end_ms": 1052340}, {"i": 1, "text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "start_ms": 1052340, "end_ms": 1053280}, {"i": 2, "text": "كَفَرُوا۟", "start_ms": 1053280, "end_ms": 1054170}, {"i": 3, "text": "لَسْتَ", "start_ms": 1054170, "end_ms": 1054740}, {"i": 4, "text": "مُرْسَلًا", "start_ms": 1054740, "end_ms": 1056440}, {"i": 5, "text": "ۚ", "start_ms": 1056440, "end_ms": 1056790}, {"i": 6, "text": "قُلْ", "start_ms": 1056790, "end_ms": 1057450}, {"i": 7, "text": "كَفَىٰ", "start_ms": 1057450, "end_ms": 1058400}, {"i": 8, "text": "بِٱللَّهِ", "start_ms": 1058400, "end_ms": 1059940}, {"i": 9, "text": "شَهِيدًۢا", "start_ms": 1059940, "end_ms": 1060740}, {"i": 10, "text": "بَيْنِى", "start_ms": 1060740, "end_ms": 1062050}, {"i": 11, "text": "وَبَيْنَكُمْ", "start_ms": 1062050, "end_ms": 1062570}, {"i": 12, "text": "وَمَنْ", "start_ms": 1062570, "end_ms": 1064020}, {"i": 13, "text": "عِندَهُۥ", "start_ms": 1064020, "end_ms": 1064640}, {"i": 14, "text": "عِلْمُ", "start_ms": 1064640, "end_ms": 1068205}, {"i": 15, "text": "ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}]}